# Cursor Rule: AI Issue To Production

- All issue, PR, CI/CD, release, deployment, and rollback work uses the
  `ai-issue-to-production` skill. If the framework cannot auto-load it, read
  `company-ai-skills/skills/ai-issue-to-production/`.

- This project is `secondary_development` + `public`, governance `L4`. Release
  source and PR target are `dev`; `main` is the upstream `ai-shifu/ai-shifu`
  sync baseline, not the company production source.

- Production images build only from `dev`, tagged with the full 40-char commit
  SHA. Never deploy `latest` or a short SHA. Server pulls images, never builds.

- Keep company release/ops docs in `lmzj-docs/`, never in upstream `docs/`.

- Use `Refs #<issue>` in PR bodies; never use Closes/Fixes/Resolves. PR merge
  is not production deployment; deploy needs explicit human confirmation.
